From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 09:14:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Remove dead NewsFeed with fabricated NGO dispatches

NewsFeed.tsx was imported nowhere and absent from the built bundle, but it
carried a MOCK_NEWS fallback of three invented human-rights dispatches
attributed to Human Rights Watch, CHRI and Reporters Without Borders, rendered
whenever the live query returned no rows.

Nothing shipped, but invented claims signed by real organisations do not belong
in the repository of a wire whose premise is source fidelity. WireFeed is the
live feed and has a proper empty state.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
